//      customise and copy to hit the port directly.
//   2. MCP servers — folded in from the old MCP page. Each server is its own
//      expandable pane with quick links to add it to Claude / Codex / Cursor
//      and the full tool list (the Memory · Tools tab now lives on hal0-memory).

